<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Alteryx Overview</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #222;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px 40px 10px 40px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .top-right-tags {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 140px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 8px;
  }
  .top-right-tags div {
    padding: 3px 4px;
    color: #333;
  }
  .tag-active {
    background: #4f81bd;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .tag-inactive {
    background: #d9d9d9;
    color: #888;
  }
  h1.title {
    color: #4f81bd;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 20px 0 15px 0;
  }
  .logo {
    position: absolute;
    top: 95px;
    right: 40px;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #333;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
  }
  .columns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .col-left {
    width: 48%;
  }
  .col-right {
    width: 52%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .section-header {
    background: #4f81bd;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  ul.bullets {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 0 5px;
    padding: 0;
  }
  ul.bullets li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  ul.bullets li::before {
    content: "\25aa";
    color: #4f81bd;
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  ul.bullets li.sub {
    margin-left: 18px;
  }
  table.mgmt {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  table.mgmt th {
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;
    padding: 3px 4px;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  table.mgmt td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 3px 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .investors-table {
    width: 100%;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    border-top: 1px solid #999;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .investors-table div.row {
    display: flex;
    padding: 3px 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
  .investors-table div.row span.label {
    width: 160px;
  }
  .sapventures {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 10px 0;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #003366;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .source {
    font-size: 10px;
    margin-top: 5px;
    color: #333;
  }

  /* Products overview right column blocks */
  .product-block {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .side-label {
    background: #4f81bd;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 12px;
    width: 26px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    transform: rotate(180deg);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6px 0;
  }
  .product-content {
    flex: 1;
    padding-left: 10px;
  }
  .product-content ul.bullets li {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .key-customers {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .customer-logos {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 15px 10px;
    row-gap: 15px;
  }
  .customer-logos .logo-item {
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .att { color: #00a0df; font-size: 18px; }
  .comcast { color: #333; font-size: 14px; text-align:center; }
  .comcast .spotlight { color: #f96302; }
  .nhs-box { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
  .nhs-badge { background:#005eb8; color:#fff; padding:2px 6px; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; }
  .experian { color: #333; font-size: 16px; }
  .experian .dots { color: #00a651; }
  .teradata { color: #d2232a; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; }

  .page-number {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 15px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #333;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="top-right-tags">
    <div class="tag-active">Analytics and Visualization</div>
    <div class="tag-inactive">Machine data</div>
    <div class="tag-inactive">Marketing &amp; e-commerce</div>
    <div class="tag-inactive">Social</div>
    <div class="tag-inactive">Market places</div>
    <div class="tag-inactive">Location/events</div>
    <div class="tag-inactive">Statistical</div>
  </div>

  <h1 class="title">Alteryx overview</h1>
  <div class="logo">alteryx</div>

  <div class="columns">
    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
    <div class="col-left">
      <div class="section-header">Business overview</div>
      <ul class="bullets">
        <li>Provides an easy-to-use analytics platform for enterprise companies making critical decisions that drive their business strategy and growth</li>
        <li>Humanizes Big Data by enabling business analysts and Data Artisans to combine Big Data with market knowledge, location insight and business intelligence</li>
        <li>Performs predictive and spatial analytics and produces analytic apps that can be shared via the private cloud or the Alteryx Analytics Gallery public cloud</li>
        <li>End markets: Automotive, commercial real estate, restaurants and entertainment, fast moving consumer goods, retail franchising and telecommunications</li>
        <li>Has 250+ customers and 200,000+ users worldwide</li>
        <li>Founded in 1997</li>
        <li>Headquartered in Irvine, CA</li>
        <li class="sub">Also has offices in Boulder and Silicon Valley</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="section-header">Management</div>
      <table class="mgmt">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:20%;">Name</th>
            <th style="width:22%;">Title</th>
            <th>Affiliations/experience</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Dean Stoecker</td>
            <td>Chairman &amp; CEO</td>
            <td>Integration Technologies, Donnelly Marketing Information Services</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>George Mathew</td>
            <td>President &amp; Chief Operating Officer</td>
            <td>SAP, salesforce.com, Fort Point Partners</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Gary Acord</td>
            <td>CFO</td>
            <td>KPMG, KACE</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="section-header">Investors</div>
      <div class="sapventures">SAP VENTURES</div>
      <div class="investors-table">
        <div class="row"><span class="label">Total capital raised:</span><span>$6.0mm</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="label">Last round:</span><span>Series A, $6.0mm</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="source">Source: Company information, Capital IQ</div>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
    <div class="col-right">
      <div class="section-header">Products overview</div>

      <div class="product-block">
        <div class="side-label">Designer desktop</div>
        <div class="product-content">
          <ul class="bullets">
            <li>Point-and-click UI: Builds analytics with no coding</li>
            <li>Personal ETL: Pulls data from internal, Big Data, or cloud</li>
            <li>Data quality tools: Builds clean and credible data sets for analysis</li>
            <li>Predictive Analytics: Pre-built R tool makes predictive accessible to all</li>
            <li>Agile database: Takes on structured, un-structured and spatial data</li>
            <li>Single-click publishing: Shares analytic apps iPrivate Cloud or Alteryx Analytic Gallery</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="product-block">
        <div class="side-label">Analytic apps</div>
        <div class="product-content">
          <ul class="bullets">
            <li>Ad hoc analysis in minutes: Designs and redesign scenarios on the fly</li>
            <li>Provides interactive charts and maps</li>
            <li>Offers spatial analysis</li>
            <li>Apps builder: Creates and shares analytic apps with a drag-and-drop wizard</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="product-block">
        <div class="side-label">Cloud server</div>
        <div class="product-content">
          <ul class="bullets">
            <li>Integrates Alteryx data, insights and applications into other systems with open API and SDK</li>
            <li>Publishes and shares analytic applications with full control over access, visibility and sharing</li>
            <li>Enables scheduled, event-triggered and ad-hoc analysis to support critical decisions across companies</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="product-block">
        <div class="side-label">API</div>
        <div class="product-content">
          <ul class="bullets">
            <li>Provides consumerization of Big Data Analytics</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="key-customers">
        <div class="section-header">Key customers</div>
        <div class="customer-logos">
          <div class="logo-item att">at&amp;t</div>
          <div class="logo-item comcast">Comcast<br><span class="spotlight">SPOTLIGHT</span></div>
          <div class="logo-item nhs-box">
            <span>Newham University Hospital</span>
            <span class="nhs-badge">NHS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="logo-item experian"><span class="dots">::::</span> Experian</div>
          <div class="logo-item teradata">TERADATA</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-number">14</div>

</body>
</html>
